[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Criselda."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぁに、アンチュ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, Antje?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このネックレスに使われてる石、私とクリセルダに\nよく似た色をしてる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The stones in this necklace... They look just like you and me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。よく分かったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. You noticed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せっかくのお揃いだもの。二人を連想できるような\n石を、一生懸命調合したのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since we're matching, I worked hard to synthesize stones that would remind us of each other."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ……これなら一緒にいても離れてても、\nクリセルダと一緒にいるみたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe... With this, whether we're together or apart, it feels like you're with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そもそも一緒にいるときは一緒にいるでしょうに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, when you're together, you are quite literally together..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ。あなた、先日の「自立する」という話は\nどうなったんです？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje. What happened to your talk about becoming independent?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ……あれはあれ、これはこれなの。\n普段は自立できるように頑張ってるもん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe... That's one thing, this is another. I'm working hard to be independent most of the time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから会えるときには、思う存分くっつくの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So when we can be together, I'm going to stay as close as I want."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。私もアンチュで癒されたいもの。\n思う存分くっつきましょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. I want Antje to comfort me too. Let's stay as close as we like."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "疲れた？\u3000このまま眠っていいのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you tired? You can fall asleep like this if you want."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。すっかり幼くなってしまって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fufu. She's become quite childlike."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "安心してくれたのかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps she feels at ease."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（極夜の錬金党の歩みは幕を閉じたけれど――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The Polar Night Alchemists have come to an end, but—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（こうして穏やかで、意外と楽しい今がある）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Now we have these peaceful, surprisingly pleasant days.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ふふ……\n\u3000これも元錬金党のみんなのおかげかもしれないわね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Hehe... Perhaps it's all thanks to my former comrades in the Polar Night Alchemists.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]